<![CDATA[<div style="text-align: center;"><font style="font-weight: bold;" color="#666666" size="7"><span style="font-family: Arial,Sans-Serif;">Get Started Today!</span></font><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Arial,Sans-Serif;" class="MsoNormal">{!Lead.FirstName},<br><br>Thank you for activating your Working Capital Account!<br></p><ul style="font-family: Arial,Sans-Serif;"><li>Credit Limit:&nbsp; Can qualify up to $150,000</li><li>Account Executive:&nbsp; {!Lead.OwnerFullName}</li></ul><p style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Arial,Sans-Serif;" class="MsoNormal">You've
 gotten this far in business by making smart decisions.&nbsp; Now it is time 
to make another one.&nbsp; Use your Working Capital Funding Card to get cash 
for your business.&nbsp; You decide how you want to use the money.&nbsp; For over 
13 years, we've helped thousands of businesses with cash needs to 
expand, purchase inventory, advertise, and pay expenses.<br><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br><b>Video:</b></span><span style="font-size: 12pt;"> </span><a href="http://www.nationalfunding.com/working-capital/#wcvideo" style="font-size: 12pt;">Working Capital Benefits Over Banks</a><br><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br>It
 only takes a few minutes to get started.&nbsp; If your business takes credit
 cards, we can get you an advance on future sales.&nbsp; If you don't take 
credit cards, we can still get you cash for any business purpose.<br></span><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br>Give me a call at {!Lead.OwnerPhone} and I will go to work for you immediately.</span></p><p><br></p><p style="font-family: Arial,Sans-Serif;">{!Lead.OwnerFullName}<br><span style="font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;">National Funding</span><br>Phone:&nbsp; {!Lead.OwnerPhone}<br>Email:&nbsp; {!Lead.OwnerEmail}</p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
